[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chocolate Retail Sales Performance Report (2023–2024)</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #3b1f0e;
    --primary-light: #6b3a1f;
    --accent: #c0622a;
    --accent-light: #e8833a;
    --gold: #c9941a;
    --gold-light: #f0c040;
    --bg: #faf7f4;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --surface-alt: #f5f0eb;
    --border: #e8ddd4;
    --text: #1a0f08;
    --text-muted: #6b5344;
    --text-light: #9c7a68;
    --success: #2e7d32;
    --success-bg: #e8f5e9;
    --info: #1565c0;
    --info-bg: #e3f2fd;
    --warning: #e65100;
    --warning-bg: #fff3e0;
    --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(59,31,14,0.08);
    --shadow-md: 0 4px 24px rgba(59,31,14,0.12);
    --radius: 10px;
    --radius-lg: 16px;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── COVER PAGE ── */
  .cover {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-light) 45%, var(--accent) 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 80px 60px 60px;
    min-height: 320px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cover::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px; right: -60px;
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .cover::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -40px; left: -40px;
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .cover-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .cover h1 {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: normal;
    line-height: 1.2;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .cover-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    opacity: 0.8;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  .cover-meta {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    opacity: 0.65;
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .cover-meta span { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
  .cover-meta strong { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }

  /* ── LAYOUT ── */
  .main {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 40px;
  }

  /* ── TOC ── */
  .toc {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 32px 36px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .toc h2 {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .toc ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: toc-counter;
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 40px;
  }
  .toc li {
    counter-increment: toc-counter;
    padding: 6px 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--border);
  }
  .toc li::before {
    content: counter(toc-counter, decimal-leading-zero);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    min-width: 24px;
  }

  /* ── SECTION ── */
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }
  .section-num {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: normal;
    color: var(--primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  /* ── KPI GRID ── */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px 18px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .kpi-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .kpi-card.highlight::before { background: var(--gold); }
  .kpi-label {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .kpi-value.large { font-size: 22px; }
  .kpi-sub {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ── CHART CONTAINERS ── */
  .chart-wrap {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px 24px 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }
  .chart-caption {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .chart-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .chart-row-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  canvas { max-width: 100%; }

  /* ── TABLES ── */
  .table-wrap {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .table-title {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 16px 20px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-alt);
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; }
  thead th {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: white;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  thead th.right { text-align: right; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--surface-alt); }
  tbody tr:hover { background: #f0e8e0; }
  tbody td { padding: 9px 14px; color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e8e0; }
  tbody td.right { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  tbody td.badge {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .rank-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent); color: white;
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .rank-badge.top3 { background: var(--gold); }

  /* ── CALLOUT / INSIGHT BOXES ── */
  .callout-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .callout {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-left: 4px solid;
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .callout.info { background: var(--info-bg); border-color: var(--info); color: #0d47a1; }
  .callout.success { background: var(--success-bg); border-color: var(--success); color: #1b5e20; }
  .callout.warning { background: var(--warning-bg); border-color: var(--warning); color: #bf360c; }
  .callout.neutral { background: var(--surface-alt); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--primary); }
  .callout strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }

  /* ── INSIGHT STRIP ── */
  .insight-strip {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-light) 100%);
    color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .insight-strip strong { color: var(--gold-light); }

  /* ── NARRATIVE ── */
  .narrative {
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .narrative strong { color: var(--primary); }

  /* ── DIVIDER ── */
  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border), transparent);
    margin: 32px 0;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .report-footer {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .report-footer strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); }

  /* ── PRINT ── */
  @media print {
    .cover { min-height: auto; padding: 48px; }
    .main { padding: 24px; }
    .section { page-break-inside: avoid; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .chart-row, .chart-row-3, .callout-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .toc ol { columns: 1; }
    .cover h1 { font-size: 26px; }
    .main { padding: 24px 16px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     COVER
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="cover">
  <div>
    <div class="cover-eyebrow">Retail Management — Internal Report</div>
    <h1>Chocolate Retail Sales<br>Performance Report</h1>
    <div class="cover-subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of sales trends, profitability, discount effectiveness, and customer behavior across 50,000 transactions spanning 2023–2024.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-meta">
    <span><strong>Period</strong>Jan 2023 – Dec 2024</span>
    <span><strong>Scope</strong>100 Stores · 50,000 Transactions</span>
    <span><strong>Prepared</strong>April 2026</span>
    <span><strong>Audience</strong>Retail Management</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     MAIN CONTENT
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="main">

  <!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS -->
  <div class="toc">
    <h2>Contents</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Executive Summary</li>
      <li>Sales Trends Over Time</li>
      <li>Product &amp; Category Performance</li>
      <li>Store &amp; Geographic Performance</li>
      <li>Discount Impact &amp; Profitability</li>
      <li>Customer Behavior &amp; Loyalty</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════
       1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
  ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="executive-summary">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-num">01</div>
      <div class="section-title">Executive Summary</div>
    </div>

    <!-- KPI Cards -->
    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi-card highlight">
        <div class="kpi-label">Total Revenue</div>
        <div class="kpi-value large">$1,275,308</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">2-year cumulative</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card highlight">
        <div class="kpi-label">Total Profit</div>
        <div class="kpi-value large">$510,548</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">2-year cumulative</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Avg Profit Margin</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">40.0%</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Per transaction</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Avg Order Value</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">$25.51</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Per transaction</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Discount Utilization</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">37.5%</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Of all orders</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Secondary KPIs -->
    <div class="kpi-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Total Orders</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">50,000</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Transactions analyzed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Active Stores</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">100</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Across all locations</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Unique Customers</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">31,531</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Distinct buyers</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Repeat Purchase Rate</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">42.0%</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Customers with 2+ orders</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="narrative">
      The chocolate retail portfolio delivered <strong>$1.28M in total revenue</strong> and <strong>$511K in profit</strong> over the 2023–2024 period, maintaining a consistently strong <strong>40% profit margin</strong> across all transaction types and discount levels. The business sustained healthy sales volumes of approximately <strong>2,083 orders per month</strong> with minimal volatility, reflecting a stable consumer demand base.
    </p>
    <p class="narrative">
      Year-over-year growth was modest but positive: <strong>2024 revenue of $643K outpaced 2023's $632K by 1.7%</strong>, and 2024 order volume (25,180) exceeded 2023 (24,820) by 1.5%. Importantly, the 40% profit margin held steady across both years — a signal that pricing and cost discipline is well-managed across the network. The top-performing store (S075) generated 30% more revenue than the lowest-performing store (S057), suggesting meaningful upside from operational benchmarking.
    </p>
    <p class="narrative">
      Discount utilization at 37.5% of orders is substantial. However, analysis reveals that discounting is not materially improving volume — discounted orders show similar average quantities (2.99 items) as non-discounted orders (3.00 items) while generating significantly lower average order values ($22.78 vs. $27.15). This is the primary strategic concern warranting management attention heading into the next fiscal year.
    </p>

    <div class="callout-grid">
      <div class="callout success">
        <strong>Strength</strong>
        40% profit margin held consistently across both years, all price points, and all discount levels — demonstrating resilient cost and pricing discipline.
      </div>
      <div class="callout warning">
        <strong>Key Risk</strong>
        Discount orders average 16% lower order values than full-price orders with no measurable quantity uplift — promotional ROI should be rigorously re-evaluated.
      </div>
      <div class="callout info">
        <strong>Opportunity</strong>
        42% of customers make repeat purchases. Deepening loyalty engagement among this segment could drive significant revenue growth without additional acquisition spend.
      </div>
      <div class="callout neutral">
        <strong>Scale</strong>
        The top store outperforms the bottom store by $3,280 in revenue (29.8%). Closing even half this gap across the bottom quartile represents ~$40K in incremental annual revenue.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════
       2. SALES TRENDS
  ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="sales-trends">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-num">02</div>
      <div class="section-title">Sales Trends Over Time</div>
    </div>

    <p class="narrative">
      Monthly revenue remained remarkably stable throughout 2023–2024, averaging <strong>$53,138 per month</strong> with a standard deviation of only ~$2,300 (4.3% coefficient of variation). This consistency indicates a well-established customer base with predictable purchasing patterns rather than a business driven by promotional spikes or seasonal surges.
    </p>

