    </div>

    <p class="narrative">
      Discount analysis is one of the most strategically important sections of this report. Discounts are applied at four distinct rates: <strong>0%, 10%, 15%, and 20%</strong>. In total, <strong>18,774 orders (37.5%)</strong> carried a discount. The central question is whether this discount volume is generating incremental business or simply transferring revenue from full-price sales.
    </p>

